{"version":1,"content":"<p>10月24日，有網友反映稱，從今天凌晨5時左右起，收到耐克、安克等品牌企業微信發送的色情引流連結。根據網友曬出的截圖，這些帶有企業標識的品牌客服賬號發送網址連結並附帶「新片每日」「免費暢享激情時刻」「告別枯燥夜生活」等引導語。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583678.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T07:22:27.137818+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T07:17:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T07:18:10.996984+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T07:18:10.996984+00:00","content_hash":"b81b62b840ea3528fff537c222973ed74c02a66116d9110238b246b4a9358b8e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}